 "topic": "No full first-person mode, but a hidden first-person view: standing still hold L2 and click R3 (can't walk); with a scoped gun the same while aiming; while driving press D-pad up to pull out the phone and you drive in first person (driving with the phone out makes handling worse)",
 "title": {
  "en": "GTA 6 has a HIDDEN first-person view 👀",
  "ar": "في GTA 6 منظور شخص أول مخفي 👀"
 },
 "summary": "GTA 6 has no full first-person mode, but there's a hidden view. Standing still, hold L2 and click R3 (LT and right stick on Xbox) to look through your character's eyes; you can't walk like this. With a scoped gun, do the same while aiming. In a car, press up on the D-pad to pull out your phone and you drive in first person, but handling gets much worse while you scroll.",
 "summary_ar": "GTA 6 ما فيها وضع شخص أول كامل، بس فيه منظور مخفي. وأنت واقف اضغط مطولًا L2 واضغط R3 وتشوف بعيون الشخصية، بس ما تقدر تمشي. مع سلاح فيه منظار سوّ نفس الشي وأنت تصوّب. وفي السيارة اضغط فوق في الأسهم وتطلع الجوال وتسوق بمنظور شخص أول، بس السواقة تخرب وأنت تتصفح.",
